  "scope": "Actual fixed37c4 graphic collision metadata, native directional path planner and ordinary local movement/frame/cache/tile-event projection. Full game remains incomplete.",
  "facts": {
    "graphics": "452460 reads seven40B GraphicInfo groups, uses recordID+prior group record count, converts source28/29bytes and30LE16 to runtime24/25/26; resourceID36->ordinal table.450100 capacity850000 zero initialized. Four conditional source overrides apply after load.463e60 primitive<20000 identity,20000..65535 +200000; >=65536 unchanged.",
    "collision": "45f1c0 clips signed-short [x-30,y-20,x+21,y+31] to map.4648f0 mode1 uses plane2 &0x100; otherwise4603a0 uses mapped ground/object classes, mode0 plane2 bit4000 for zero ground, class4/runtimeclass2 overrides walkability, other blockers and northward object footprint, empty-cell and lowbyte1 final overrides.4607c0 blocks outside and only cellvalue1 inside.",
    "path": "462650 uses source facing helper and candidate offsets0,+1,-1 restricted to initial direction±1, odd-direction corner checks,462520 orthogonal-to-diagonal merge, then x and y fallback. Route contains signed-short endpoint arrays, capacity100. A same-point request clears finalFacing but preserves prior route; outer capacity100 clears route, unsafe fallback overflow rejected independently. Not A*.",
    "batching": "461b30 takes at most2 pending route steps;462bf0 and462c50 shift queues.461b70 sends lowercase byte+97 with current origin andscene field11 only when partyMode0 orflags100; pure ordinary projection requires explicit no-party context.",
    "movement": "462110 targets display grid+direction at speed*source0.01f, float32 normalized velocity×4 and source facing;461660 squares frameScale1 velocity, advances orsnaps, updates grid atarrival and idle on followingtick, preserving animation1 phase.4ff5a0 collision rolls display back to prior actor grid but leaves target/scaled position/velocity independent.",
    "missing_cache": "460820 for full51x51 windows scans 23 raw plane2 words in direction-leading strips atx19/41,y9..31 andy9/31,x19..41; firstzero produces clipped rectangles, atmost2.461e90 sends map requests andsets wait before target is consumed.463ea0 clears wait only after refreshed window is complete.",
    "events": "461960 examines batch endpoints: lowbyte2 stops before entry(type3); lowbyte3/9/10/11/13 andconditional6/7/8 schedule type1 afterentry.451b60 derives selector from rawsource value;4a31b0 isfixed0.461ac0 decrements onprior arrival andexecutes nexttick.461d00/461e00 reset movement, setguard/sequence andsend004f6530 eventcode/sequence/x/y/direction. UI/audio/fade andresponses remain incomplete.",
    "turn": "462410 checks idle/existing actor/differentface, native turn/action guards, strict unsigned lastTick+500 < currentTick;uppercase byte+65 is sent through004f6470. Source wrap behavior retained."
  },
